        "params.category1": "Geodatabase Settings (optional)",
        "summary": "<xdoc><p>Creates a parcel fabric and its associated datasets. The parcel fabric is created in a feature dataset that resides in a file, enterprise, or mobile geodatabase.</p><p>The parcel fabric is created as a controller dataset that controls the following datasets:</p><p><ul><li>Parcel fabric topology</li><li>Records feature class</li><li>Connections feature class</li><li>Points feature class</li></ul></p><p>Parcels are added to the parcel fabric as parcel types. Use the Add Parcel Type tool to add parcel types to the parcel fabric. The Connections, Points, and parcel type feature classes participate in the parcel fabric topology.</p></xdoc>",
